    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><em>At some point in Ardor’s history shortly after the Awakening, chroniclers and scholars began to note something curious; felines were disappearing. Gone were the town’s local litters of cats, or the wild cats of the forest. Lions in Freke, tigers in the Isles of Mann, and cougars in Gere all became scarce. Around this time, upright, confused felines began to wander into towns. These are the lyncan – the first of Ardor’s magically evolved races.</em></p><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.journals.JournalEntry.HO16IW50jXn58kdN.JournalEntryPage.rRJC5tQhTT2tmBgE]{Lyncan}</p>"
